15168,ZMC Express Cargo - Dubai Air Shipping | Custom Clearance | Best Logistics and Shipping Companies in Dubai,https://www.zmcexpress.com/,"Bill of Lading (B/L) vs. Air Waybill (AWB): Know the Key Differences! 🚢✈️ Choosing between sea freight and air freight involves different documentation requirements: • Bill of Lading (B/L): Primarily used for ocean freight. Crucially, an original B/L acts as a document of title, meaning ownership of the goods can be transferred and it is legally required to claim cargo at destination. • Air Waybill (AWB): Exclusively used for air cargo. An AWB functions as a receipt of goods and transport contract, but it is non-negotiable and does not transfer ownership. Whether moving cargo by air, sea, or cross-border land routes, ZMC Express Cargo ensures smooth logistics and end-to-end documentation support. 📞 Contact our freight experts today to optimize your supply chain!","UAE, Germany, Oman with customs clearance",logistics companies Dubai,,,,,https://www.linkedin.com/company/zmc-express-cargo/,"info@zmcexpress.com, zmcleb@zmcexpress.com, bgw@zmcexpress.com, ebl@zmcexpress.com, isu@zmcexpress.com, duhok@zmcexpress.com, mosul@zmcexpress.com, kirkuk@zmcexpress.com, diyala@zmcexpress.com, anbar@zmcexpress.com, nasiriyah@zmcexpress.com","+9647730933600, +9647716156666, +9647711181557, +96176512901, +9647707922277, +9647512354493, +9647701966570, +9647713505005",tel_link,0.98,mailto_link,0.98,SAP,,,"Discovery: Maps card, Website crawl",2026-10-13T19:32:23.090788
